{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unhinged is an open-world survival craft game where you find yourself trapped in a bizarre corporate experiment. Explore a brutal open world, build modular machines and survive mind-bending trials to uncover the terrifying truth that brought you here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a retro-futuristic island controlled by a high-tech corporate giant. Scavenge the island for resources and craft tools that help you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664200/extras/0a0e96ab806b056b8126a3013770caa5.poster.avif?t=1761328286\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664200/extras/0a0e96ab806b056b8126a3013770caa5.webm?t=1761328286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664200/extras/0a0e96ab806b056b8126a3013770caa5.mp4?t=1761328286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct modular machines, build bases, harvest electricity, automate processes, and expand your footprints on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664200/extras/2662246d1118c3f180fc89c1b59408ff.poster.avif?t=1761328286\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664200/extras/2662246d1118c3f180fc89c1b59408ff.webm?t=1761328286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664200/extras/2662246d1118c3f180fc89c1b59408ff.mp4?t=1761328286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain a balanced diet, forge your path through dangerous biomes, overcome the corporate trials, confront unsettling entities, and fight to maintain your sanity... or risk becoming UNHINGED.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664200/extras/8255e8e11c0c8dc0bba6524214ab22bd.poster.avif?t=1761328286\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664200/extras/8255e8e11c0c8dc0bba6524214ab22bd.webm?t=1761328286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664200/extras/8255e8e11c0c8dc0bba6524214ab22bd.mp4?t=1761328286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity System:</strong> More than hunger or thirst, your mind is your foremost need. Manage your brain chemical imbalances in one of the most complex sanity systems ever seen in survival games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Systemic Crafting:</strong> Experiment freely with ingredients to cook food, brew tea and synthesise drugs. From lethal failures to superhuman breakthroughs, every craft expands your mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contraption Building:</strong> Build machines, vehicles, and inventions from modular blocks. Your creativity determines your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trials:</strong> Scattered across the island, these corporate games test your resourcefulness. Conquer them using every tool at your disposal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automation:</strong> Set up bases connected with pipes and conveyors to automate tasks, leaving you free to focus on exploration and survival.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664200?t=1761328286","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664200?t=1761328286","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664200/1da9b859b91baa81328e54df2fa54e25f2fe9d75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761328286","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664200/1da9b859b91baa81328e54df2fa54e25f2fe9d75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761328286","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Join Private Playtest</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664200/extras/e4deac02eab9a43bc781d32e0476e467.avif?t=1761328286\" width=960 height=258 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unhinged is an open-world survival craft game where you find yourself trapped in a bizarre corporate experiment. Explore a brutal open world, build modular machines and survive mind-bending trials to uncover the terrifying truth that brought you here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a retro-futuristic island controlled by a high-tech corporate giant. Scavenge the island for resources and craft tools that help you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay m